     "body": {
      "html": "<div style=\"background: linear-gradient(rgba(201,219,226,.85), rgba(201,219,226,.85)), url('https://4087538.fs1.hubspotusercontent-na1.net/hubfs/4087538/private-label/womenssupps.png') center/cover; padding: 90px 20px; text-align: center;\">\n  <div style=\"max-width: 900px; margin: 0 auto;\">\n    <p style=\"color: #012638; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 2px; margin: 0 0 14px;\">PRIVATE LABEL WOMEN'S HEALTH SUPPLEMENTS</p>\n    <h1 style=\"color: #012638; font-size: 48px; font-weight: 700; line-height: 1.15; margin: 0 0 22px;\">Supplements built around the unique nutritional needs of women across every life stage.</h1>\n    <p style=\"color: #012638; font-size: 19px; line-height: 1.5; margin: 0 0 34px;\">Women have unique nutritional needs that vary throughout their life stages. Supplements designed for women's health address these requirements by offering a blend of vitamins, minerals, and essential nutrients. They support reproductive health, promote bone strength, help bridge dietary gaps, and contribute to overall well-being.</p>\n    <a href=\"#get-started\" style=\"display: inline-block; background: #6BA644; color: white; padding: 16px 38px; text-decoration: none; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; border-radius: 4px; letter-spacing: .5px;\">Talk to Our Team</a>\n  </div>\n</div>"
     },
     "id": 216201609525,
     "type": "rich_text"
    },
    {
     "body": {
      "html": "<div style=\"max-width: 850px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 80px 20px 50px;\">\n  <h2 style=\"color: #012638; font-size: 32px; font-weight: 700; line-height: 1.25; margin: 0 0 26px;\">Build a women's health supplement line with proven formulations.</h2>\n  <p style=\"color: #333; font-size: 18px; line-height: 1.65; margin: 0 0 18px;\">The women's health supplement market is growing and rewards brands that bring specialized, high-quality solutions. Partnering with DaVinci ensures supplements made with premium ingredients, scientifically backed formulations, and truth-in-labeling commitment.</p><p style=\"color: #333; font-size: 18px; line-height: 1.65; margin: 0 0 18px;\">With direct access to over 250 doctor-formulated supplements, low minimums, and no set-up fees, you can build out a complete product line that fits your audience. Choose from our catalog of ready-to-launch formulations, customize the branding, and we handle manufacturing and fulfillment.</p>\n</div>"
     },
     "id": 216201609526,
     "type": "rich_text"
    },
    {
     "body": {
      "html": "<div style=\"background: #c9dbe2; padding: 70px 20px;\">\n  <div style=\"max-width: 1100px; margin: 0 auto;\">\n    <p style=\"color: #6BA644; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 2px; text-align: center; margin: 0 0 14px;\">HOW IT WORKS</p>\n    <h2 style=\"color: #012638; font-size: 32px; font-weight: 700; text-align: center; margin: 0 0 50px; line-height: 1.2;\">Get to market faster with a partner who handles the heavy lifting.</h2>\n    <div style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(260px, 1fr)); gap: 40px;\">\n      <div style=\"text-align: left;\">\n      <p style=\"color: #6BA644; font-size: 56px; font-weight: 800; line-height: 1; margin: 0 0 14px;\">01</p>\n      <p style=\"color: #012638; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 1.5px; margin: 0 0 14px;\">BUILD YOUR PRODUCT LINE</p>\n      <p style=\"color: #012638; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin: 0; opacity: .85;\">Direct access to over 250 doctor-formulated supplements with low minimums and no set-up fees. Choose what fits your audience and your timeline.</p>\n    </div><div style=\"text-align: left;\">\n      <p style=\"color: #6BA644; font-size: 56px; font-weight: 800; line-height: 1; margin: 0 0 14px;\">02</p>\n      <p style=\"color: #012638; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 1.5px; margin: 0 0 14px;\">DESIGN YOUR BRAND</p>\n      <p style=\"color: #012638; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin: 0; opacity: .85;\">Use your existing logo, customize a new label, or pick from our professional templates. Our in-house design team brings your vision to life.</p>\n    </div><div style=\"text-align: left;\">\n      <p style=\"color: #6BA644; font-size: 56px; font-weight: 800; line-height: 1; margin: 0 0 14px;\">03</p>\n      <p style=\"color: #012638; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 1.5px; margin: 0 0 14px;\">START SELLING FAST</p>\n      <p style=\"color: #012638; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin: 0; opacity: .85;\">Launch in as little as 3 to 4 weeks after approving your labels. Every product passes rigorous quality assurance before it ships.</p>\n    </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>"
     },
