     "body": {
      "html": "<div style=\"background: #012638; color: white; padding: 90px 20px;\">\n  <div style=\"max-width: 1100px; margin: 0 auto; display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 60px; align-items: center;\">\n    <div><img src=\"https://www.pettechlabs.com/hubfs/Private%20Label/Images/Womens_Health.jpg\" alt=\"Women's Health supplements\" style=\"width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 6px;\"/></div><div>\n      <p style=\"color: #6BA644; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 2px; margin: 0 0 14px;\">WHY DAVINCI FOR WOMEN'S HEALTH</p>\n      <h2 style=\"font-size: 32px; font-weight: 700; line-height: 1.2; margin: 0 0 20px;\">Tailored formulations, premium ingredients, truth-in-labeling commitment.</h2>\n      <p style=\"font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.65; opacity: .9; margin: 0;\">The women's health market rewards brands that bring specialized, scientifically backed solutions. Our private-label line is built around the unique needs of women across every life stage. Holistic, science-driven formulations that customers can trust to actually work, with the ingredient transparency they expect.</p>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>"
     },
     "id": 216201609531,
     "type": "rich_text"
    },
    {
     "body": {
      "html": "<div style=\"background: #f7f7f6; padding: 80px 20px;\">\n  <div style=\"max-width: 1200px; margin: 0 auto;\">\n    <h2 style=\"color: #012638; font-size: 32px; font-weight: 700; text-align: center; margin: 0 0 16px;\">Build across multiple health categories</h2>\n    <p style=\"color: #555; font-size: 17px; text-align: center; max-width: 760px; margin: 0 auto 48px;\">Most brands start with one category and expand. Combine women's health with adjacent categories to grow lifetime value per customer.</p>\n    <div style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(180px, 1fr)); gap: 24px;\">\n      <a href=\"/private-label-fitness\" style=\"display: block; text-decoration: none;\">\n      <div style=\"background: white; border-radius: 10px; overflow: hidden; box-shadow: 0 4px 16px rgba(1,38,56,.08);\">\n        <img src=\"https://4087538.fs1.hubspotusercontent-na1.net/hubfs/4087538/private-label/fitnesssupps.png\" alt=\"Fitness\" style=\"width: 100%; height: 160px; object-fit: cover; display: block;\"/>\n        <div style=\"padding: 18px 20px; text-align: center;\">\n          <p style=\"color: #012638; font-size: 17px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0;\">Fitness</p>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </a><a href=\"/private-label-herbal\" style=\"display: block; text-decoration: none;\">\n      <div style=\"background: white; border-radius: 10px; overflow: hidden; box-shadow: 0 4px 16px rgba(1,38,56,.08);\">\n        <img src=\"https://4087538.fs1.hubspotusercontent-na1.net/hubfs/4087538/private-label/herbalsupps.png\" alt=\"Herbal\" style=\"width: 100%; height: 160px; object-fit: cover; display: block;\"/>\n        <div style=\"padding: 18px 20px; text-align: center;\">\n          <p style=\"color: #012638; font-size: 17px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0;\">Herbal</p>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </a><a href=\"/private-label-aging\" style=\"display: block; text-decoration: none;\">\n      <div style=\"background: white; border-radius: 10px; overflow: hidden; box-shadow: 0 4px 16px rgba(1,38,56,.08);\">\n        <img src=\"https://4087538.fs1.hubspotusercontent-na1.net/hubfs/4087538/private-label/agingsupps.png\" alt=\"Aging\" style=\"width: 100%; height: 160px; object-fit: cover; display: block;\"/>\n        <div style=\"padding: 18px 20px; text-align: center;\">\n          <p style=\"color: #012638; font-size: 17px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0;\">Aging</p>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </a><a href=\"/private-label-sleep\" style=\"display: block; text-decoration: none;\">\n      <div style=\"background: white; border-radius: 10px; overflow: hidden; box-shadow: 0 4px 16px rgba(1,38,56,.08);\">\n        <img src=\"https://4087538.fs1.hubspotusercontent-na1.net/hubfs/4087538/private-label/sleepsupps.png\" alt=\"Sleep\" style=\"width: 100%; height: 160px; object-fit: cover; display: block;\"/>\n        <div style=\"padding: 18px 20px; text-align: center;\">\n          <p style=\"color: #012638; font-size: 17px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0;\">Sleep</p>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </a><a href=\"/private-label-probiotics\" style=\"display: block; text-decoration: none;\">\n      <div style=\"background: white; border-radius: 10px; overflow: hidden; box-shadow: 0 4px 16px rgba(1,38,56,.08);\">\n        <img src=\"https://4087538.fs1.hubspotusercontent-na1.net/hubfs/4087538/private-label/probioticsupps.png\" alt=\"Probiotics\" style=\"width: 100%; height: 160px; object-fit: cover; display: block;\"/>\n        <div style=\"padding: 18px 20px; text-align: center;\">\n          <p style=\"color: #012638; font-size: 17px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0;\">Probiotics</p>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </a><a href=\"/private-label-weight-loss\" style=\"display: block; text-decoration: none;\">\n      <div style=\"background: white; border-radius: 10px; overflow: hidden; box-shadow: 0 4px 16px rgba(1,38,56,.08);\">\n        <img src=\"https://4087538.fs1.hubspotusercontent-na1.net/hubfs/4087538/private-label/weightsupps.png\" alt=\"Weight Management\" style=\"width: 100%; height: 160px; object-fit: cover; display: block;\"/>\n        <div style=\"padding: 18px 20px; text-align: center;\">\n          <p style=\"color: #012638; font-size: 17px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0;\">Weight Management</p>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </a>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>"
